    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1497590/extras/d812798394efa67e763aacb9ab9c3780.poster.avif?t=1659367918\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1497590/extras/d812798394efa67e763aacb9ab9c3780.webm?t=1659367918\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1497590/extras/d812798394efa67e763aacb9ab9c3780.mp4?t=1659367918\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><br><br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1497590/extras/69c226bee47003e87f5ec49ceadc4596.avif?t=1659367918\" /></div><br>With <strong>Saints and Sinners</strong> give a life to Sinner in Dark Medieval Era or join the Saints to find Sinner among them and execute him in front of others. With your 4-8 friends or other players use in-game chat or voice chat to find who is Sinner or prove that you are not a Sinner! In this multiplayer thriller themed game all lies and slanders are free.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1497590/extras/34a883d59658e9e80038a298844a1eee.avif?t=1659367918\" /></div><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>With completing all tasks, perform the rituel and find who is Sinner.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Follow the Sinner's traces using Magic Globe without him knowing it.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Team up with other Saints against the Sinner's blackout and lockdown abilities.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Start votings to execute the one whom you have doubts about and convince the other Saints in this way.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>And the most important is <strong>Stay ALIVE!</strong>.</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1497590/extras/45ebbf1b35e20247510bf4dd9260fcaa.avif?t=1659367918\" /></div><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Kill all Saints before they detect you.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Give Saints a silent and hidden dead using Silent Step and Vision abilities.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>With blackout and lockdown abilities ambush Saints.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Mingle with Saints by pretending you are completing the tasks.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Blame others in voting sessions to get rid of executions.</li></ul>",
